            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

The variable this position indexes -- an @id-reference to one declared elsewhere in the document, matching cdi:indexes on PrimaryKey. A key names variables that are defined once and referenced from the key, so an inline variable here would be a second copy of a node that already exists; framing inlines the target and the embedded copy then had to be told apart from authored content.</body>
