          <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

Reusable data-structure description for this distribution. One of the four DataStructure variants (DataStructure, Dimensional, Long, Wide) as an inline definition, or an @id reference to one declared elsewhere in the document or published at a resolvable URI. (A profile may further require the inline form via SHACL.)
:union: ``anyOf``</body>
