          <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

Structure of a long dataset (organized collection of long data). It is described by identifier, measure, attribute, variable descriptor and variable value components.
:idDescription: "Identifier for this LongDataStructure node"
:rdfType: ``cdi:LongDataStructure``
:exportedDef:</body>
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.profiles.cdifProfile.cdifDataStructure.LongDataStructure"/>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedAttribute xmi:type="uml:Property" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.profiles.cdifProfile.cdifDataStructure.LongDataStructure.has_DataStructureComponent" xmi:uuid="d1b2efce-cc5b-524b-8751-4230875ac4a5">
